  "passage": "Dear Community Members, We are excited to announce the Meadowbrook School Circus, taking place on Saturday, 15th June. The event will start at twelve o'clock in the school hall and finish by four p.m. Following the main show, you can enjoy various activities, including face painting, which requires make-up provided by our art club. If you encounter any trouble during the event, please look for volunteers in blue shirts or send a message to the school office. For food and drinks, we accept all major currencies, but tokens are recommended for faster service. The circus will feature amazing acts from our students, including juggling, acrobatics, and animal shows with cute puppies. Bring your family for a day of fun and laughter! Remember, entry is free, but donations are welcome to support our school's new library. The following classes will perform: Class 5A will do a magic show, and Class 6B will present a dance routine. If you need any assistance, don't hesitate to ask. We look forward to seeing you there!",
